Usage: agent-deck triggers fires <id> [--limit N] [--json]

The recent fire log of one trigger, newest first: when, at which session, the
outcome, and its first line (sanitized, secrets redacted, 80 cells). Kept 7 days,
at most 2000 fires per trigger.

Options:
  -json
    	Output as JSON
  -limit int
    	Newest fires to show (default 50)
